uestion/worked-solution "Let $g(x)=8x-7$ and $f(g(x))=g(x{)}^{4}.$ \n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(g(x)) & =({g}^{4}{)}^{′}=4{g}^{3}, \\\\ {g}^{′}(x) & =(8x-7{)}^{′}=8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the chain rule, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={f}^{′}(g(x))\\cdot {g}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =4{g}^{3}\\cdot (8) \\\\  & =32(8x-7{)}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-71954/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0a312840-0d35-50bb-94b3-b04778f4efc3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71954"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection/f52511d2a90674e2c26443788baac44136f3dceb24bf4611ae09ed5e681a534a" :answer/id #uuid "0df93ae9-22cc-55a7-8da8-9ba8f076fdc7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15(2+5x{)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection/f0e4b0792c43b2d5934ceee13dc80d6aaa28fcaa89fd7e6b65ac969f4553731b" :answer/id #uuid "9f614676-3109-5eeb-8a0a-ebd7282b49c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15(2+5x{)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection/a2bf642f8c50ab19e5fbe77841d8b7cb385eeeaf58be288da7422d1e5f517267" :answer/id #uuid "8abf7c00-e618-5e47-b7ca-e3fb931c02f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15(2-5x{)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection/983efb0ec41522dfca724e8ca217e05333e3c79c7d9fa8110fe79c141a252332" :answer/id #uuid "5e5d534f-9d61-5da6-a247-5425ad14f9d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15(2-5x{)}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection/3a617d3e9e0a9cedb86c92674d37f3abd74bb21abdc426b0b8aa907b29455bbd" :answer/id #uuid "04bce5ff-030a-51e2-a2f9-4e96ac1cd564" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15(2-5x{)}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71956/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3992b64-0510-5227-bfa6-4e9505929bf6" :answer-field/key "selecti